<td><span class=3D"c16">4,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">5,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">6,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">7,</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class=3D"c16">do,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">re,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">mi,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">fa,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">sol,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">la,</span></td>
<td><span class=3D"c16">si.</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>5=C2=BA One can also write in a special <b>Solresol</b> stenography. Thi=
s stenography, invented by <a href=3D"https://mozai.com/writing/not_mine/so=
lresol/#note">Vincent GAJEWSKI</a>, is composed of only seven signs, one fo=
r every syllable:</p>
