i>Mister</i>, <b>sso</b>.........<img src=3D"https://mozai.com/writing/not_=
mine/solresol/sso.gif" align=3D"middle" alt=3D"-"><br><br> <i>Language</i>,=
 <b>sorso</b>.....<img src=3D"https://mozai.com/writing/not_mine/solresol/s=
orso.gif" align=3D"middle" alt=3D"-"><br><br> <i>Want</i>, <b>fsf</b>......=
.....<img src=3D"https://mozai.com/writing/not_mine/solresol/fsf.gif" align=
