ai.com/writing/not_mine/solresol/dsf.gif" align=3D"middle" alt=3D"-"><br><b=
r><br> <i>Experience</i>, <b>mssod</b>...<img src=3D"https://mozai.com/writ=
ing/not_mine/solresol/mssod.gif" align=3D"middle" alt=3D"-"><br>A double no=
te is represented by crossing the sign:<br><i> Printshop</i>, <b>llmd</b>..=
...<img src=3D"https://mozai.com/writing/not_mine/solresol/llmd.gif" align=
=3D"middle" alt=3D"-"><br><br><i> December</i>, <b>rrs</b>.......<img src=
